{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lady in Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Yuri Mystery Visual Novel set in 18th-century Joseon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A woman hiding behind a man\u2019s name.<br>A runaway noble girl with a secret.<br>When their paths cross, truth and desire begin to unravel.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady in Mystery</strong> is a <i>Yuri</i> mystery visual novel set in <strong>18th-century Korea</strong>,<br>where disguise, love, and truth intertwine beneath the strict Confucian order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once an ordinary noble girl, <strong>Heesoo</strong> lost everything when her family was executed under false charges.<br>Disguised as a man, she escapes to the capital and opens an information shop called <i>Jeonghuso</i>,<br>gathering whispers and solving cases to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five years later, just as she begins to rebuild her life,<br>a runaway noblewoman named <strong>Juhee</strong> appears\u2014<br>and Heesoo\u2019s carefully constructed world begins to crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578950/extras/230e21db3a97a4f2b94a5cfe01977e96.avif?t=1759978059\" width=620 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 A <strong>mystery &amp; Yuri</strong> visual novel set in <strong>18th-century Joseon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8c <strong>4 romance routes</strong>, each with unique investigations and storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>30+ endings</strong>, including <strong>5 true endings</strong> shaped by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Rich CGs and atmospheric backgrounds inspired by Korean traditional art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Stories of deception, love, and identity in a society bound by rules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Define Her Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love or Revenge.<br>Truth or Disguise.<br>Every decision brings you closer to one truth\u2014<br>or to the darkness that lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Have Faith in Her","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/9b6bb3777bca283fb8d569270c53d60381b347a2.jpg"},{"name":"The First Case Has Been Solved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/5c4fd1cd4bdee9d8115fb073148e530c08e070d7.jpg"},{"name":"Take This Flower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/acab4e797a1f3067140a4bc859f84a5f1741036b.jpg"},{"name":"The Words That Couldn't Be Spoken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/d736ce00ba41c188896a7a3801eafaebab4f5419.jpg"},{"name":"Masked Singer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/e0d5cee2a0cd7708ba4fcbfebf24d23514209c9e.jpg"},{"name":"At the Crossroad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/1fc18fd2189beb8114896aa7dcd60f7e996c72c9.jpg"},{"name":"Love is an open door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/b0873b8eb83f274b312aca53bdba4d1b6d2a8ca0.jpg"},{"name":"Femme Fatale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/15d763b3d4d1eee449305a14ea3d065707209c10.jpg"},{"name":"Detective from The Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578950/9756